Z||000000||Leadfoot||07-10-2001||02:42 PM||||I just polished a set of rims which I received from Oreif (Thanks!).  However, now my dilemma is what tire to put on it? In the future I plan on painting my car yellow.  So I have been tossing around the idea of painting the non-polished webbing on the wheel yellow.  I also thought it might look neat if I can get the Goodyear tires that just have GOODYEAR written in yellow on the side wall.  Does anyone know where I can get some tires like that?  If not, what tires do you guys/gals recommend?  One last question, what size should I go with...the p195/70r14 or the 215/60p4 (I was thinking of using the latter for an increased footprint)?||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrgone||07-10-2001||02:50 PM||||i think the yellow tire is a nascar promotional tire, if they have not come out with another tire that features those.<P>but if you cant get the yellow sidewall, i think those tires that have the yellow stripes on the tread would look cool. but those are pricey. they leave cool burnout marks though!<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature_9.jpg">   <BR><B>86.5 2m4 5speed turd 241,000kms</B>||||reg||1
