Z||000009||Monkeyman||07-10-2001||09:42 PM||||I just shod 4Play with some nice Yokohama Avids.  225/50R15s.  They stick very well.  I think I paid around $325 for the set including mounting and balancing.  I could have got a better deal if I had shopped around but I was in a hurry and had to go to the local tire shop (long, boring story).<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
